  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>'<p>Glide through your daily run with a smoother stride in the Nike Zoom Vomero 5 NA36. Merging 2000s running DNA with contemporary design, these shoes offer a refined mix of style, performance, and thoughtful innovation. The breathable and durable materials keep you comfortable and supported through long runs, while the Zoom Air cushioning ensures a smooth ride. Stay fast, stay fresh, and keep rolling forward in the Nike Zoom Vomero 5 NA36.</p> <p><strong>Nike Zoom Vomero 5 NA36 features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Synthetic leather on the upper offers durability.</li> <li>Plastic caging on the side enhances support.</li> <li>Air Zoom cushioning helps provide a quick-off-the-ground sensation.</li> <li>Reflective details add visibility in low-light conditions.</li> <li>Rubber outsole delivers durable traction.</li> </ul> <p>*Not intended for use as Personal Protective Equipment (PPE).</p><hr /><p>Long days on your feet feel easier when comfort and style show up together. Blending early-2000s running inspiration with everyday wearability, the Nike Zoom Vomero 5 NA36 delivers lightweight cushioning, breathable structure, and a layered look that stands out without feeling overdone. It is built for everything from commuting and travel to everyday errands and all-day wear.</p><ul><li>Breathable upper with synthetic leather for structure and durability</li><li>Plastic side caging adds support and signature Vomero 5 style</li><li>Air Zoom cushioning helps create a smooth, responsive feel</li><li>Reflective details add low-light visibility</li><li>Rubber outsole provides durable traction</li></ul>  <p><strong>Size &amp; Fit Guidance</strong></p><p>For the best fit, most shoppers can start with their usual size. If you prefer a little extra room through the forefoot or have wider feet, a half size up may feel more comfortable while still keeping the shoe secure.</p>  <p><strong>Best For</strong></p><p>Best for everyday wear, city walking, commuting, travel, and light workouts when you want cushioned comfort with a polished retro-running look.</p>  <p><strong>Styling &amp; Versatility</strong></p><p>Reviewers consistently call out how easy this pair is to wear with everything from leggings and jeans to shorts and skirts. The mix of mesh, glossy overlays, and running-inspired lines gives it enough detail to elevate casual outfits while still feeling right for daily movement.</p>  <p><strong>Break-In &amp; Durability</strong></p><p>Many shoppers say the comfort shows up right away, with little to no break-in needed. The supportive build and durable outsole make it a go-to for repeated daily wear, and some pairs feel even better after the first few outings as the shoe settles in.</p>  <p><strong>Care &amp; Maintenance</strong></p><p>To help preserve the mesh and layered finishes, gentle spot cleaning with a soft cloth is a smart choice. Let them air dry to keep the materials looking fresh for everyday rotation.</p>\"</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike Zoom Vomero 5 NA36 - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Tan/Gold</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Breathable mesh upper with durable synthetic overlays and rubber traction outsole</td></tr